{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "ccfc260481b0b660ec3bc7c63ab26219d353e63001b9b3e5bed1a68919b1b76f", "ja": "あの～、{$P$}さん……。\n私、こないだの温泉に忘れ物してもうたみたいで……。", "zh": "那个～{$P$}先生……\n我好像有东西忘在之前去的温泉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5f6308c0d2c8b547a0643b72160e3008c41e709c65679eadfc2aca93468f2a8", "ja": "そうなのか？　なら、旅館に連絡して送ってもらうよ。\n何を忘れたんだ、奈緒？", "zh": "是这样吗？那我去连络旅馆请他们寄回来。\n你忘了什么东西，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "8fe37e6eb81f97cd2657c7d68564ba4f4fe4f9baac001ee3221069a677bc99b5", "ja": "はい、ラムネの瓶です！", "zh": "嗯，是弹珠汽水瓶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ac7c68546f1ee580c2df51af2532fec6d308193df2e85ff5522238c8b1de868d", "ja": "ラムネの瓶？　温泉の後に、飲んでた？", "zh": "弹珠汽水瓶？泡完温泉后喝的那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "54c1c601fa73c9fc7d89a0ee47565172a285ec1f91f8efbcbec52923852948b8", "ja": "それです！　せっかく綺麗に洗っといたのに……\n荷物に入れ忘れたんかな～。", "zh": "就是那个！我还特地把它洗干净耶……\n是忘了把它放进行李吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c87ec4147fc41e8af6aa840b631ea04a09c19efd9bcc3a5f061fa034f3a33827", "ja": "{$P$}さんとカンパイした思い出、\n記念に取っときたかったのに……。", "zh": "本来想带回来纪念\n和{$P$}先生干杯的回忆说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "42a12a5f4e68f81fdc89d52c49532b1126272f4fb175a9967e993bbebf22503c", "ja": "そうか……でも、ラムネの瓶はちょっと……。\nゴミとして、もう捨てられてるかもしれないな。", "zh": "是吗……不过弹珠汽水瓶的话，说不定……\n已经被当作垃圾丢掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "3ce672b4bf006c2bc059a30aee9df854a64c9d5579cd1dd97372ac23a3553802", "ja": "ええ～！？　そんな、せっかくの記念やのに……\nああ～、どないしよう……。", "zh": "咦咦～！？怎么会，明明是难得的纪念品……\n啊啊～怎么办啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d0d3f81cdc6b839059559af0d7f3950553a18b1c413b5a63f2bdb269fdc63474", "ja": "そんなに落ち込まなくても……温泉じゃなくても\nラムネは飲めるんだし、また乾杯しよう。", "zh": "用不着那么沮丧嘛……就算不在温泉，\n也能喝弹珠汽水啊，我们再干杯一次吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "463c0fbb3d1c2ad932a9a4990fe3a1771ba67d8cb3d2bbb0d80ff4e2f751426b", "ja": "えっ、ホンマですか？\nほな私、今からラムネ買いに行ってきます！", "zh": "咦，真的吗？\n那我现在就去买弹珠汽水！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "22ad3c28a6ab13fe49aa935a0b40db74975d35bcdd54cb2c9b8555afe1947053", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nちょっとだけ、ちょっとだけ待っといてくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n一下下就好，请你等一下下嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6eea32478db79a84822a5829b19e4b24d3e53228bc948922e8f3289396f3618a", "ja": "え、今？\nって、奈緒……もう行っちゃったか。", "zh": "咦，现在？\n啊，奈绪……走掉了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "280fbe4f5f7a5323bf3ec8066090fe7b690257cf864baae382805987d52af58e", "ja": "ぷはぁ～！　温泉の後ほどやないけど、\nやっぱりラムネはおいしいですね♪", "zh": "噗哈～！虽然比不上刚泡完温泉后喝的感觉，\n不过弹珠汽水还是很好喝吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b9d50b59da96e196b1b284b1890ab403bfdb934e3a5552083e5fd59816931d6e", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。奈緒の仕事が成功した後なら、\n場所が温泉じゃなくても、きっとおいしいと思う。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。只要是在奈绪顺利完成工作之后，\n就算不在温泉也一定很好喝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "7834e8a37e1a9589e4e52a9354ef6b5b5107768a20611d0c699d81b9d0a9d17f", "ja": "そ、そうですよね……えへ、えへへ♪\nなんや、照れますね……♪", "zh": "也、也是……嘿、嘿嘿♪\n总觉得有点害羞耶……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0023_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "a8784a24a71ed1ed9737a9de81f4a5bddf6e3778df397bd15aa72b511be2166f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　また、おいしい\nラムネが飲めるように、私、メッチャ頑張りますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！为了能再喝到\n好喝的弹珠汽水，我会多多努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
